

# Forget Curve Memo (iOS) – Engineer Specification v1.0

Last updated: 2025-10-01

---

## 0. Purpose

“Forget Curve Memo” is an iOS app that delivers **notifications at the optimal timing for review** based on the **forgetting curve**. The user simply registers “Deck name / Range / Page,” and will then receive reminders depending on the selected “forgetfulness profile” (5 levels).

---

## 1. KPIs

* D1 onboarding completion ≥ 80%
* At least one review completed within 7 days of first registration ≥ 60%
* 30-day retention (active at least once per week) ≥ 25%
* Free → Paid conversion rate ≥ 8%

---

## 2. Target / Assumptions

* Target: **Range-based study** such as language learning and exam prep (e.g., textbook p.19–25, Chapter 2).
* Platform: iOS 17+ / iPadOS 17+
* Language: Japanese (future: English / Traditional Chinese)
* Offline first. Sync planned later (iCloud/CloudKit optional for v1).

---

## 3. Terminology

* **Item**: Minimum review unit. A unique combination of deck name + range + page.
* **Deck**: A collection of items with the same deck name.
* **Profile**: Forgetfulness level (Ultra Forgetful / Forgetful / Normal / Smart / Ultra Smart).
* **Review**: A review session triggered by a notification. Results can be logged (Again/Hard/Good/Easy). For v1, simplified to default=Good with optional Bad/Good/Great.

---

## 4. User Stories

1. As a learner, I want to register **deck name, range, and page** and receive notifications at the **optimal time** based on the forgetting curve.
2. As a learner, I want to adjust notification **frequency** with 5 levels of forgetfulness.
3. As a learner, I want to use a **free quota (10 items)** and upgrade to **paid (50 items)** if needed.
4. As a learner, I want to set a **quiet notification window** (e.g., no midnight alerts) and receive **batched notifications**.
5. As a learner, I want to see **progress and next scheduled reviews**.

---

## 5. Screens (Information Design)

1. **Home / Today’s Reviews**

   * Today’s total and remaining reviews, preview of next notification
   * “Review Now” button (advance review earlier)
2. **Item List (by Deck)**

   * Search / Filter (deck, due date, profile)
