4. **Settings**

   * Notification permission & time window (e.g., 7:00–22:00)
   * Daily notification batches (1–3)
   * Default profile (for new items)
   * Badge ON/OFF
   * Data export/import (CSV, optional in v1)
   * App info & privacy policy
5. **Upgrade / Limits**

   * Free: 10 items max / Paid: 50 items max
   * StoreKit2 purchase/restore
6. **Progress / Statistics** (optional in v1.1)

   * Weekly completion rate, streaks, total reviews

> **UI:** SwiftUI (modern), Dynamic Type, SF Symbols, dark/light modes, minimal haptics.

