## 6. Functional Requirements

* CRUD for Items (create, edit, delete)
* 5 profile–based **review scheduling**
* **Local notifications** (UNUserNotificationCenter)
* **Batch notifications** (1–3 times per day, within set window)
* Background rescheduling (BGTaskScheduler, daily)
* Item limits (Free: 10 / Paid: 50) + StoreKit2 payments
* Badge for pending items
* Time zone / daylight saving safety

---

## 7. Non-Functional Requirements

* Performance: Home load < 300ms (for <100 items)
* Reliability: Idempotent scheduling jobs, automatic correction for drift
* Data protection: Use Keychain / ProtectedUntilFirstUserAuthentication (best practice)
* Failure recovery: Re-generate schedule on app launch
* Pending notification cap: OS-dependent. Use **rolling reservations** (7 days only).

