## 11. Payment & Limits

* Free: max 10 items (includes archived in v1).
* Paid: max 50 items.
* StoreKit2 purchase: **non-consumable (buy once)** in v1. (Subscription future option).
* Flow: At limit → dialog → upgrade screen (features, price, restore).

---

## 12. Notification Specification

* Category ID: `review_batch`
* Actions:

  * `review_now` → open app “Today’s Reviews”
  * `snooze` → shift to next batch
* Example content:

  * Title: `Today's Reviews (3 items)`
  * Subtitle: `Priority: {deck} {rangeText}…`
  * Badge: pending item count
* Pending = 7 days of **batch notifications only** (no per-item).

---

## 13. Background

* Daily refresh with `BGAppRefreshTask` (e.g., early morning).
* Also recalc on app launch/foreground.

---

## 14. Errors & Exceptions

* Permission OFF: fallback banner/reminder in Home (badge/widget).
* No window set: default 7–22, 1 batch/day.
* Time zone change: store in UTC, realign on display.

---

## 15. Accessibility / Localization

* Support Dynamic Type, VoiceOver, WCAG AA contrast.
* Localizable.strings for JA/EN/ZH.

---

## 16. Analytics (Opt-in)

* Events: `onboarding_complete`, `item_created`, `review_completed`, `purchase_succeeded`.
* Crash: Organizer/Crashlytics (no PII).

